{"title": "Carm's Garms", "pageid": 12270, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Carm's_Garms", "categories": ["Locations", "Act Three Locations"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Carm%27s_Garms_Street_View.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1f/Carm%27s_Garms_Street_View.jpg/300px-Carm%27s_Garms_Street_View.jpg.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1f/Carm%27s_Garms_Street_View.jpg/450px-Carm%27s_Garms_Street_View.jpg.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1f/Carm%27s_Garms_Street_View.jpg/600px-Carm%27s_Garms_Street_View.jpg.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1f/Carm%27s_Garms_Street_View.jpg/300px-Carm%27s_Garms_Street_View.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"159\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1f/Carm%27s_Garms_Street_View.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption><div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">  Street View  </div></figcaption></figure>\n<table class=\"relative-location\" style=\"float:right; width:200px; clear:right;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td colspan=\"5\" class=\"relative-location-header\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wyrm%27s_Crossing\" title=\"Wyrm's Crossing\">Wyrm's Crossing</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"5\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wyrm%27s_Rock_Fortress\" title=\"Wyrm's Rock Fortress\">Wyrm's Rock Fortress</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"5\" style=\"text-align:center;\">↑\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:25%\"><a href=\"/wiki/Danthelon%27s_Dancing_Axe\" title=\"Danthelon's Dancing Axe\">Danthelon's Dancing Axe</a>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:7.5%\">←\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:25%; align-items: center;\"><b>Carm's Garms</b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:7.5%\">\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:25%\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"5\" style=\"text-align:center;\">↓\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"5\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sharess%27_Caress\" title=\"Sharess' Caress\">Sharess' Caress</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table><b>Carm's Garms</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Location\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Location\">Location</a> within <a href=\"/wiki/Wyrm%27s_Crossing\" title=\"Wyrm's Crossing\">Wyrm's Crossing</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Act_Three\" title=\"Act Three\">Act Three</a> of <a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Gate_3\" title=\"Baldur's Gate 3\">Baldur's Gate 3</a>. It is a clothing store selling various <a href=\"/wiki/Camp_Clothing\" title=\"Camp Clothing\">camp clothing</a> items, as well as <a href=\"/wiki/Dye\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Dye\">dyes</a> to diversify them.\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r356266\">.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote{display:grid;margin:10px 4px}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-right{padding:8px 16px;margin:auto}@media screen and (max-width:779px){.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-right{margin-top:10px;padding:8px 2px;border-left:0!important;grid-row:2;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-right,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-left{margin:auto;grid-row:1;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author{grid-row:3;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote{justify-content:center!important}}@media screen and (min-width:780px){.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left{margin-left:10px;border-left:2px solid #3d3d3d!important;grid-row:1;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-right{margin-right:10px;border-left:0!important;border-right:2px solid #3d3d3d;grid-row:1;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-right{margin:auto 0;grid-row:1;grid-column:3}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-left{margin:auto 0;grid-row:1;grid-column:1}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author{grid-row:2;grid-column:2}}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author{margin-left:auto;margin-right:32px;font-size:smaller;font-weight:bold}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end{font-size:300%;font-family:serif;color:#3d3d3d;line-height:1em}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin{margin-bottom:auto;margin-right:8px}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end{margin-top:auto;margin-left:8px}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-text{font-style:italic}</style><div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote\" style=\"justify-content: center\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-left\" style=\"display: inline-block; height: calc(70px + 2*4px); width: calc(70px + 2*4px); clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 100% 50%, 50% 100%, 0% 50%); background: black;\"><span style=\"display: inline-block; margin: 4px; width: 70px; height: 70px; clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 100% 50%, 50% 100%, 0% 50%);\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Carmen_Pennygood\" title=\"Carmen Pennygood\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/aa/Portrait_Carmen_Pennygood.png/70px-Portrait_Carmen_Pennygood.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/aa/Portrait_Carmen_Pennygood.png/105px-Portrait_Carmen_Pennygood.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/aa/Portrait_Carmen_Pennygood.png/140px-Portrait_Carmen_Pennygood.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/aa/Portrait_Carmen_Pennygood.png/70px-Portrait_Carmen_Pennygood.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/aa/Portrait_Carmen_Pennygood.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><blockquote style=\"font-size: 100%\" class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left\">\n  <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center\">\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin\">“</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-text\">If it's genuine quality, and genuine taste, you're after - Carm's Garms has you covered.</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end\">„</div>\n  </div>\n</blockquote><div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author\">— <a href=\"/wiki/Carmen_Pennygood\" title=\"Carmen Pennygood\">Carmen Pennygood</a></div><div style=\"grid-column:3\"></div></div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Overview\">Overview</span></h2>\n<p>Carm's Garms<sup id=\"cite_ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> is a two-storied building located in the north-east of <a href=\"/wiki/Wyrm%27s_Crossing\" title=\"Wyrm's Crossing\">Wyrm's Crossing</a>, across from <a href=\"/wiki/Danthelon%27s_Dancing_Axe\" title=\"Danthelon's Dancing Axe\">Danthelon's Dancing Axe</a>. It has no cellar, featuring a subjacent tunnel instead, accessible from the outside wooden sidewalks of the Crossing bridge. Near the store building, three machinery enthusiasts - <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Trinigan_Gazotts\" title=\"Trinigan Gazotts\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/71/Portrait_Trinigan_Gazotts.png/25px-Portrait_Trinigan_Gazotts.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/71/Portrait_Trinigan_Gazotts.png/38px-Portrait_Trinigan_Gazotts.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/71/Portrait_Trinigan_Gazotts.png/50px-Portrait_Trinigan_Gazotts.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Trinigan Gazotts\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/71/Portrait_Trinigan_Gazotts.png/25px-Portrait_Trinigan_Gazotts.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/71/Portrait_Trinigan_Gazotts.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Trinigan_Gazotts\" title=\"Trinigan Gazotts\">Trinigan Gazotts</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Slozy_Arminifer\" title=\"Slozy Arminifer\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/15/Portrait_Slozy_Arminifer.png/25px-Portrait_Slozy_Arminifer.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/15/Portrait_Slozy_Arminifer.png/38px-Portrait_Slozy_Arminifer.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/15/Portrait_Slozy_Arminifer.png/50px-Portrait_Slozy_Arminifer.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Slozy Arminifer\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/15/Portrait_Slozy_Arminifer.png/25px-Portrait_Slozy_Arminifer.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/15/Portrait_Slozy_Arminifer.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Slozy_Arminifer\" title=\"Slozy Arminifer\">Slozy Arminifer</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Vinegaroon\" title=\"Vinegaroon\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4a/Portrait_Vinegaroon.png/25px-Portrait_Vinegaroon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4a/Portrait_Vinegaroon.png/38px-Portrait_Vinegaroon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4a/Portrait_Vinegaroon.png/50px-Portrait_Vinegaroon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Vinegaroon\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4a/Portrait_Vinegaroon.png/25px-Portrait_Vinegaroon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4a/Portrait_Vinegaroon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Vinegaroon\" title=\"Vinegaroon\">Vinegaroon</a> - discuss spiritedly the technical features of the Steel Watchers.\n</p><p>The store is owned by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Carmen_Pennygood\" title=\"Carmen Pennygood\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/aa/Portrait_Carmen_Pennygood.png/25px-Portrait_Carmen_Pennygood.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/aa/Portrait_Carmen_Pennygood.png/38px-Portrait_Carmen_Pennygood.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/aa/Portrait_Carmen_Pennygood.png/50px-Portrait_Carmen_Pennygood.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Carmen Pennygood\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/aa/Portrait_Carmen_Pennygood.png/25px-Portrait_Carmen_Pennygood.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/aa/Portrait_Carmen_Pennygood.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Carmen_Pennygood\" title=\"Carmen Pennygood\">Carmen Pennygood</a>, the sister of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Figaro_Pennygood\" title=\"Figaro Pennygood\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e0/Portrait_Figaro_Pennygood.png/25px-Portrait_Figaro_Pennygood.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e0/Portrait_Figaro_Pennygood.png/38px-Portrait_Figaro_Pennygood.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e0/Portrait_Figaro_Pennygood.png/50px-Portrait_Figaro_Pennygood.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Figaro 'Facemaker' Pennygood\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e0/Portrait_Figaro_Pennygood.png/25px-Portrait_Figaro_Pennygood.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e0/Portrait_Figaro_Pennygood.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Figaro_Pennygood\" title=\"Figaro Pennygood\">Figaro 'Facemaker' Pennygood</a>, the owner of <a href=\"/wiki/Facemaker%27s_Boutique\" title=\"Facemaker's Boutique\">Facemaker's Boutique</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Lower_City\" title=\"Lower City\">Lower City</a>. Their relationship is uneasy, as both are keen to carry on their deceased father's metier, but deem each other unapt in tailoring and fashion. One of the blackboards standing in the tradehall says that the proprietor does not take on mending clothes from the Facemaker's, as those are hopeless, while one of letters in the backroom states the same opinion of Figaro's on his sister's works.\n</p><p>Carmen offers a fair amount of <a href=\"/wiki/Camp_Clothing\" title=\"Camp Clothing\">Camp Clothing</a> to buy (from Common to Rich grades), as well as lots of Rare <a href=\"/wiki/Dye\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Dye\">dyes</a>. In several containers around the store, including the second floor, the party may also steal several random clothing items of the same quality.\n</p><p>Inside the store the party can also meet <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Naaber\" title=\"Naaber\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ce/Portrait_Naaber.png/25px-Portrait_Naaber.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/ce/Portrait_Naaber.png/38px-Portrait_Naaber.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/ce/Portrait_Naaber.png/50px-Portrait_Naaber.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Naaber\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ce/Portrait_Naaber.png/25px-Portrait_Naaber.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/ce/Portrait_Naaber.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Naaber\" title=\"Naaber\">Naaber</a>, a meddlesome young man who starts to follow the player character once they enter, prompting them to talk. If talked to, he starts to imitate various character <a href=\"/wiki/Class\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Class\">Classes</a> one by one separately (therefore, it takes 12 times to hear out all his attempts). However, if the player character goes through it resignedly, Naaber rewards their patience with <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Absolute_Confidence_Amulet\" title=\"Absolute Confidence Amulet\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b6/Amulet_Necklace_D_Bronze_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Amulet_Necklace_D_Bronze_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b6/Amulet_Necklace_D_Bronze_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Amulet_Necklace_D_Bronze_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b6/Amulet_Necklace_D_Bronze_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Amulet_Necklace_D_Bronze_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b6/Amulet_Necklace_D_Bronze_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Amulet_Necklace_D_Bronze_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b6/Amulet_Necklace_D_Bronze_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Absolute_Confidence_Amulet\" title=\"Absolute Confidence Amulet\">Absolute Confidence Amulet</a>. Within the dialogues when Naaber is imitating a Bard and a dog (which comes instead of Druid class) the player character may also earn approval from their companions.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Characters\">Characters</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Carmen_Pennygood\" title=\"Carmen Pennygood\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/aa/Portrait_Carmen_Pennygood.png/30px-Portrait_Carmen_Pennygood.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/aa/Portrait_Carmen_Pennygood.png/45px-Portrait_Carmen_Pennygood.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/aa/Portrait_Carmen_Pennygood.png/60px-Portrait_Carmen_Pennygood.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Carmen Pennygood\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/aa/Portrait_Carmen_Pennygood.png/30px-Portrait_Carmen_Pennygood.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/aa/Portrait_Carmen_Pennygood.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Carmen_Pennygood\" title=\"Carmen Pennygood\">Carmen Pennygood</a> - trader</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Naaber\" title=\"Naaber\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ce/Portrait_Naaber.png/30px-Portrait_Naaber.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/ce/Portrait_Naaber.png/45px-Portrait_Naaber.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/ce/Portrait_Naaber.png/60px-Portrait_Naaber.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Naaber\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ce/Portrait_Naaber.png/30px-Portrait_Naaber.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/ce/Portrait_Naaber.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Naaber\" title=\"Naaber\">Naaber</a></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Outside_the_building\">Outside the building</span></h3>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Slozy_Arminifer\" title=\"Slozy Arminifer\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/15/Portrait_Slozy_Arminifer.png/30px-Portrait_Slozy_Arminifer.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/15/Portrait_Slozy_Arminifer.png/45px-Portrait_Slozy_Arminifer.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/15/Portrait_Slozy_Arminifer.png/60px-Portrait_Slozy_Arminifer.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Slozy Arminifer\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/15/Portrait_Slozy_Arminifer.png/30px-Portrait_Slozy_Arminifer.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/15/Portrait_Slozy_Arminifer.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Slozy_Arminifer\" title=\"Slozy Arminifer\">Slozy Arminifer</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Trinigan_Gazotts\" title=\"Trinigan Gazotts\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/71/Portrait_Trinigan_Gazotts.png/30px-Portrait_Trinigan_Gazotts.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/71/Portrait_Trinigan_Gazotts.png/45px-Portrait_Trinigan_Gazotts.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/71/Portrait_Trinigan_Gazotts.png/60px-Portrait_Trinigan_Gazotts.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Trinigan Gazotts\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/71/Portrait_Trinigan_Gazotts.png/30px-Portrait_Trinigan_Gazotts.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/71/Portrait_Trinigan_Gazotts.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Trinigan_Gazotts\" title=\"Trinigan Gazotts\">Trinigan Gazotts</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Vinegaroon\" title=\"Vinegaroon\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4a/Portrait_Vinegaroon.png/30px-Portrait_Vinegaroon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4a/Portrait_Vinegaroon.png/45px-Portrait_Vinegaroon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4a/Portrait_Vinegaroon.png/60px-Portrait_Vinegaroon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Vinegaroon\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4a/Portrait_Vinegaroon.png/30px-Portrait_Vinegaroon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4a/Portrait_Vinegaroon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Vinegaroon\" title=\"Vinegaroon\">Vinegaroon</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Loot\">Loot</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Absolute_Confidence_Amulet\" title=\"Absolute Confidence Amulet\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b6/Amulet_Necklace_D_Bronze_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Amulet_Necklace_D_Bronze_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b6/Amulet_Necklace_D_Bronze_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Amulet_Necklace_D_Bronze_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b6/Amulet_Necklace_D_Bronze_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Amulet_Necklace_D_Bronze_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b6/Amulet_Necklace_D_Bronze_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Amulet_Necklace_D_Bronze_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b6/Amulet_Necklace_D_Bronze_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Absolute_Confidence_Amulet\" title=\"Absolute Confidence Amulet\">Absolute Confidence Amulet</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Seemingly_Gleaming_Ring\" title=\"Seemingly Gleaming Ring\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Ring_H_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Ring_H_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Ring_H_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Ring_H_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Ring_H_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Ring_H_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Ring_H_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Ring_H_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Ring_H_1_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Seemingly_Gleaming_Ring\" title=\"Seemingly Gleaming Ring\">Seemingly Gleaming Ring</a></span> - if the amulet above has been stolen from Naaber before trying out all his options</li></ul>\n<p>Carmen sells a variety of <a href=\"/wiki/Dyes\" title=\"Dyes\">dyes</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Camp_Clothing\" title=\"Camp Clothing\">Camp Clothing</a> items.\n</p>\n<ul><li>Several Rare <a href=\"/wiki/Dyes\" title=\"Dyes\">Dyes</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dye_Remover\" title=\"Dye Remover\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cf/Dye_Remover.png/30px-Dye_Remover.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cf/Dye_Remover.png/45px-Dye_Remover.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cf/Dye_Remover.png/60px-Dye_Remover.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cf/Dye_Remover.png/30px-Dye_Remover.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cf/Dye_Remover.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Dye_Remover\" title=\"Dye Remover\">40x</a></span></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Literature\">Literature</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typ